{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02783","headline":"明月引 · 卢照邻","name":"明月引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭波起兮鸿雁翔，风瑟瑟兮野苍苍。\n浮云卷霭，明月流光。\n荆南兮赵北，碣石兮潇湘。\n澄清规於万里，照离思於千行。\n横桂枝於西第，绕菱花於北堂。\n高楼思妇，飞盖君王。\n文姬绝域，侍子他乡。\n见胡鞍之似练，知汉剑之如霜。\n试登高而骋目，莫不变而回肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}